<% content_for :title, "Spenotes — Notes pour kinésithérapeutes" %>

<div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">

  <%# ── Hero ── %>
  <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center px-6 pt-16 pb-10 text-center">
    <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-sp-primary flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
      </svg>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-sp-primary leading-tight mb-3">
      Spenotes
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-sp-accent font-medium mb-4">
      Notes cliniques pour kinésithérapeutes
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto">
      Rédigez vos comptes-rendus rapidement, avec une reconnaissance vocale adaptée au vocabulaire kiné.
    </p>

    <%# CTAs %>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 mt-8">
      <%= link_to new_user_registration_path, class: "w-full py-4 rounded-2xl bg-sp-primary text-white font-semibold text-base text-center" do %>
        Créer mon compte
      <% end %>
      <%= link_to new_user_session_path, class: "w-full py-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-200 text-sp-primary font-semibold text-base text-center shadow-sm" do %>
        Se connecter
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# ── Features ── %>
  <div class="px-6 pb-12 flex flex-col gap-4">

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm flex gap-4 items-start">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sp-bg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-sp-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-sp-primary mb-1">Gestion des patients</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Fiches patients avec historique complet de toutes les séances.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm flex gap-4 items-start">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sp-bg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-sp-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 11a7 7 0 01-7 7m0 0a7 7 0 01-7-7m7 7v4m0 0H8m4 0h4m-4-8a3 3 0 01-3-3V5a3 3 0 116 0v6a3 3 0 01-3 3z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-sp-primary mb-1">Dictée &amp; écoute réunion</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Transcription en direct avec reconnaissance du vocabulaire anatomique et latin.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm flex gap-4 items-start">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sp-bg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-sp-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-sp-primary mb-1">Synthèse &amp; recommandations IA</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Résumé automatique de séance et suggestions cliniques générés par IA.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm flex gap-4 items-start">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sp-bg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-sp-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-sp-primary mb-1">Vocabulaire personnalisé</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Vos acronymes et termes métier injectés dans chaque transcription.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm flex gap-4 items-start">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sp-bg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-sp-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-sp-primary mb-1">Photos &amp; pièces jointes</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Ajoutez des clichés directement depuis votre appareil photo.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">Données de santé hébergées en sécurité · RGPD</p>
  </div>

</div>
